id: ops-release-continuation
title: Release continuation frees the runner while protected PR checks run
description: "Implement pm-ops#249: durable candidate intent, hourly reconciliation and daily catch-up, protected auto-merge, owned supersession and the local caller pilot."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[2]: "area:release","gh:unbraind/pm-ops#249"
created_at: "2026-11-06T04:32:10.197Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-06T05:17:10.271Z"
author: codex-sol
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-06T04:32:12.566Z",codex-sol,"Plan: persist the verified candidate before requesting protected squash auto-merge, then exit. An hourly caller and daily catch-up inspect intent without installing dependencies; only a trusted merged candidate enters publication. Serialize all caller events, bind candidate/artifact/run/config identities, and refuse ambiguous registry or provenance results. Full live pilot and account-wide admission evidence remain outside this task authorization; PR will use Refs #249. Run targeted tests, lint and typecheck locally; CI owns the full gate."
  "2026-11-06T04:43:41.909Z",codex-sol,"Implementation now has a dependency-free TypeScript probe, versioned candidate receipt in the bot PR, immutable run artifact retained for 90 days, exact source/digest/config checks and a publication-attempt journal. The hourly path skips installs when no intent exists. Sixteen new focused state/adapter tests pass, including late CI, suppressed bot push, hostile identity, crash recovery and authoritative supersession. Migrating legacy workflow-shape tests to the shared implementation and documenting the read-only fleet inventory."
  "2026-11-06T05:00:39.230Z",codex-sol,"Behavioral revert proofs ran in disposable copies only. Twenty paired regressions each failed with its relevant guard/transition reverted: runner-held merge loop, late CI, stale-base refresh, fork/foreign-branch/exact-head/artifact ownership, merged identity, trusted preparation, required protection, ambiguous publication attempt, live daily cap, downloaded bytes, receipt parsing/schema, authoritative supersession and hourly pilot wiring. Restoring the fixed implementation passed all 20 tests (11 decision + 9 adapter). Targeted package set passed 512 tests with zero failures/skips; lint, typecheck, build:test and docstrings passed; duplication is 0% across 125 sources. Focused release-continuation coverage is 100/100/100/100. Full npm/Bun release gates are delegated to PR CI as requested; no publication, merge, other-repository edit or hosted change was performed."
  "2026-11-06T05:05:45.702Z",codex-sol,"Tightened native protection evidence: enumerate every required context and issuing app from the branch policy, bind the rollup to the exact PR head, and refuse missing/truncated policy evidence. The read-only native reader also succeeded against the existing release PR using the installed gh API transport, without newer checks JSON flags. Focused decision/adapter suite now passes 21/21; its added native-policy regression has a paired behavioral revert. Missing classic policy, moved main, expired artifacts and ambiguous registry absence remain explicit refusals; live publishing identity and fleet-wide capacity admission remain rollout work."
  "2026-11-06T05:14:24.339Z",codex-sol,"Final local targeted command passed 513 tests with no failures or skips. The additional self-pilot resolver fixture passed and failed when its untagged-bootstrap behavior was reverted, bringing the behavioral proof set to 22. The 21 continuation regressions pass after restoration; focused decision coverage remains 100/100/100/100. Pinned pm linked tests (continuation, lint, typecheck) all passed. Canonical publish-attestation audit passed with the shared workflow as the single publisher. Ambient tracker health detects an existing globally discovered extension/CLI version skew; the isolated CI identity passed strict health with required merge drivers. The dependency pin is unchanged. Full npm/Bun gates await PR CI."
  "2026-11-06T05:17:08.468Z",codex-sol,"PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ops/pull/250 is open at implementation commit b80ea3a5dc33f23196ff6f730045c4109f86bf39. Initial CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ops/actions/runs/42167374486 and CodeQL https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ops/actions/runs/42167373992 are queued. These are pending receipts, not gate approval. This handoff receipt and claim release will be committed before exact-head CI verification. The task leaves both pm items open; no review bot was requested or awaited. Full issue acceptance remains Refs #249 pending the authorized live pilot, shared-capacity admission tests and fleet rollout measurements."
